                                "sense_id": "4284979d-5372-363b-82ca-35e0186d19f6",
                                "text": "As our exports and imports are now nearly in balance, it is assumed that such bargaining, if agreed to, would induce the debtor nations to greatly increase their purchasings from us […]"
